  "mn78:11.12": "Taking the suffix <i lang='pi' translate='no'>-maya</i> in the same sense as <i lang='pi' translate='no'>tammaya</i>; see my note on <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn47/en/sujato#13.4'>MN 47:13.4</a>. The point is that they are not formed by and hence limited by the scope of ethics. ",
